  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "獨立研究(二)",
    "sub_ename": "INDEPENDENT STUDY(2)",
    "describe_ch": "獨立研究作為教育的一種形式，涉及直接研究、且是個人在較少或甚至無監督的情形下進行 研究的教育活動。學生和教授共同討論出一個研究主題，並在教師的輔導 (tutorial meetings) 下 進行研究。本學期的主要目標是協助學生面對該解決的問題，並擬定研究方法及策略。",
    "describe_eh": "Independent study is a form of education. It is referred to as directed study, and is an educational activity undertaken by an individual with little to no supervision. A student and professor agree upon a topic for the student to research with guidance from the tutor for an agreed upon amount of credits.The goal of this semester to help student to elucidate the problems and establish the strategies to solve the practical problems.",
